          <!-- Text Column -->
          <div class="col-xxl-6 order-xxl-2 order-2">
            <h2 class="brand-text display-2">About Us</h2>
            <div class="text-start">
              <p>Our regular (3 out of 4 Saturdays) off-road rides are 1.5-2 hours long - Typically along the towpath to
                Mytchett canal café or out towards Odiham/Greywell and other suitable routes away from traffic, these
                are all advertised in our <a href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/LJ1XZhB7KprApZhr4plhGD" target="_blank"
                  role="button" class="brand-text">WhatsApp Group <i
                    class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right brand-text"></i></a>.</p>
              <p>Regular Meet Point is <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/Rz6o6LjYwvr6974ZA" target="_blank"
                  class="brand-text">Google Maps <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right brand-text link-icon"> </i></a>.</p>
              <p>Departure Time : 09:30 for all Regular Rides (see <a href="#ride-diary" class="brand-text">Ride
                  Diary</a>)</p>
              <p>Please check detail of Longer Rides (see <a href="#ride-diary" class="brand-text">Ride Diary</a>
                section) for Meet Point and departure time</p>
              <p>Once a month we also aim to offer a longer ride, please check out our <a href="#ride-diary"
                  class="brand-text">Ride Diary</a>.</p>
              <p>Ride style is relaxed, easy-paced social riding at 8 - 10 mph average - We wait for everyone!</p>
              <p>We welcome all age groups, although under 18 years old riders must bring along their own adult.</p>
              <p>Note: We also have a couple of <a href="https://app.box.com/s/yg7tl246oz2p3kvby9ugw5jj5yu1gced"
                  target="_blank" class="brand-text">Loan Bikes <i
                    class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right brand-text link-icon"> </i></a> that we are happy to lend out to
                anyone who wants to try this.</p>
            </div>
